  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/480696/Diamond-Spheres-Thaumic-Potential?affiliate_id=3028400\">Diamond Spheres: Thaumic Potential</a></sup></p>\n<p>You gain a +4 bonus to saving throws against written magical effects, ‘symbol’ effects, and similar effects (such as explosive runes, glyph of warding, symbol of death, etc), as well as any effects that may originate from reading a book, inscription, scroll, or any form of writing (such as a curse), but not from effects cast from such forms of writing (such as a scroll of fireball). You gain an automatic Perception check to notice such effects that you come 10 feet within, although this is made in secret by the GM.</p>\n<p>In addition, you can decipher magical writings on objects that would otherwise be unintelligible, such as those found in scrolls.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/study#toc19\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
